{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12105290","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12105290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1210529001:1":{"text":"ゴホッ！ゴホゴホッ！","source_cn":"咳、咳咳咳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2551F5F917AAF195","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210529002:1":{"text":"あんたの負けだ。","source_cn":"你输了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E54565BD0AFA7FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210529003:1":{"text":"私を殺すのか、ソニア？","source_cn":"索尼娅，你要杀了我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x757508617C25ACE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210529004:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210529005:1":{"text":"私はお前の「父」だぞ……あの時、私が助けなければ、お前は妹と同じ、海の底に沈んでいた。","source_cn":"我是你的“父亲”……当年，如果不是我把你救起，你早就死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC73C622C1756AC0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210529006:1":{"text":"分かっている。","source_cn":"我知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB188B8685FB0426C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210529007:1":{"text":"剣術を教え、学校にも行かせ、実の娘のように育てたお前に組織まで任せたというのに……この私を粛正するのか？人の心を捨てるというのか？","source_cn":"我把你当亲生孩子一样养大，教你剑术，让你上学……甚至还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27E2299C450B3A00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210529008:1":{"text":"お前の胸に血の薔薇をつけ、皆に私の「娘」だと宣言し、お前は私に永遠の忠誠を誓うと約束した日のことを覚えているか？","source_cn":"还记得吗？我把血薇别在你胸口，告诉所有人，你就是我的“...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF275628B24D43C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210529009:1":{"text":"覚えているさ。","source_cn":"没忘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x663CF830BBC86C2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210529010:1":{"text":"私の……私の娘よ、認めるんだ……お前は私を殺さないし、殺せないはずだろう……","source_cn":"我的……我的孩子。你不可能杀我，你也杀不了我。认命吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75297F6DEC6B6F59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210529011:1":{"text":"オヤジ……","source_cn":"父亲……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x968A077B58AA7863","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210529012:1":{"text":"おいおい、ソニアさんよ、まさか本気にしてないよな？","source_cn":"不是吧，索尼娅，你吃这套？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDC002211A1692C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210529013:1":{"text":"テシオがあんたのことを家族だと思ってるって？だったら、俺とルカの若頭が血の繋がった兄弟だったっていう方がよっぽど真実味があるね！","source_cn":"你相信泰西欧当你是亲人？还是信我和卢卡是失散多年的亲兄弟？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D71ECC3716F0A22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210529014:1":{"text":"誰がお前の兄弟だって？","source_cn":"谁是你兄弟？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9C8A0111D692ABF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1210529015:1":{"text":"うるさい。ルカ、そいつに手錠をかけろ。","source_cn":"真啰嗦。卢卡，铐上他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F24B98342068D10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1210529016:1":{"text":"はっ。","source_cn":"是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46CC2E142C5C636F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1210529017:0":{"text":"なっ！？ソニア！よくも部下にこの私を……！","source_cn":"——你？！索尼娅？！你竟然让手下碰我？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00F4F67716672BD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1210529018:1":{"text":"なんだ、手錠をかけろって、このじいさんのことだったのか。カハハッ！","source_cn":"原来是给这老东西上铐？哈哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA08EF50BC5EE6E59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1210529019:1":{"text":"オヤジ、あんたは年を取った。口うるさくなったし、目も悪くなったようだな。","source_cn":"父亲大人，你真的老了，变唠叨了，而且眼神也不好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x935603B770632451","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1210529020:1":{"text":"よく見ろ！ソニアは、誰の子どもでもない。","source_cn":"看清楚！我，索尼娅，不是谁的孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66226F16D0C1C266","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1210529021:1":{"text":"あんたが死ぬことで……あたしはブラッディ・マリーの真のボスになるんだ。","source_cn":"我是血薇帮的老大——在你死后。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC141A8564ECD59D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1210529022:1":{"text":"お前……","source_cn":"你竟敢——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC734E413241FCCDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1210529023:1":{"text":"かつてラスティーアンカーには海賊が横行し、多くの住民が街を離れようとしていた。","source_cn":"当年，锈锚港海盗横行，很多人想离开锈锚港。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x700E431B9AF9A52C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1210529024:1":{"text":"だからあんたは海難事故を起こした。部下に船のマストを折らせ、船倉に爆弾を積んでな。そして、海に落ちた人たちをこれ見よがしに救助した。","source_cn":"于是你策划了一场海难，你让人磨断了桅杆，船舱里绑了炸药...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35DCCEBBD6E771AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1210529025:1":{"text":"案の定……その海難事故でブラッディ・マリーの評判は一気に上がり、人々はあんたのことを崇め始めた。","source_cn":"果然……海难后，血薇帮的人望迅速攀升，大家都尊称你为教父。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67AAE50BF54CC9AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1210529026:1":{"text":"なぜそれをあたしが知っているって？","source_cn":"奇怪我怎么知道的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D3F7E586E3F8348","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1210529027:1":{"text":"あんたの教育のたまものだよ。","source_cn":"别忘了，你把我教的很好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8F6B7ABB8AEA235","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1210529028:1":{"text":"ふん、私がやつらに新たな命を与えてやった……私は救世主なのだ。","source_cn":"这有什么，我给了他们新的生命……我就是他们的救世主。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C70FD60C0DFF760","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1210529029:1":{"text":"救世主の救いがほしければ、それなりの見返りが必要なんだよ。","source_cn":"所有人都应该知道，救世主的帮助不是无偿的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A7E8F9F3237A713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1210529030:1":{"text":"だが救世主が罪を犯せば、同じく償う必要がある。","source_cn":"救世主犯下罪孽也是要偿还的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FE2EA5EF02A565C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1210529031:1":{"text":"ブラッディ・マリーに血を与えて何が悪い？美しい花を咲かせるには、血ぬれの肥料が一番効果的なんだ。","source_cn":"我用鲜血哺育血薇帮，有什么错呢？花要想开的好，沾血的肥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3A0B0C41AD4DC46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1210529032:1":{"text":"詭弁はもうたくさんだ。あんたには裁きを受けてもらう。","source_cn":"别狡辩了，你会迎来审判。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3B2FB44EBA8536B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1210529033:1":{"text":"……裁き、だと？","source_cn":"……审判？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AA401EDA8F4FE0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1210529034:1":{"text":"ふっ、思い上がるなよ！","source_cn":"还不到时候！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEAAE898129BCA93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:泰西欧":{"text":"テシオ","source":"泰西欧","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"ソニア","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"シンドバッド","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"ルカ","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":35,"localized_text_count":34,"speaker_count":4}}